{"seq":2,"slug":"analog-layout-and-pcb","title":"模拟版图与 PCB","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/analog-circuit-design/practice-and-reliability/analog-layout-and-pcb","wordCount":2085,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"模拟版图与-pcb\">模拟版图与 PCB</h1><p>一个在 SPICE 里相位裕度 70 度、CMRR 90 dB 的运放，做成芯片后偏置点漂了 5 mV、CMRR 掉到 55 dB——问题几乎不在原理图，而在版图。模拟电路的性能由原理图给出上限，由版图决定能拿回多少。同一个道理在板级重演：一颗 24 位 ADC 的有效位数（ENOB）在数据手册上是 21.8，到了客户的板子上变成 18，差的 3.8 位往往是几条数字走线压在了模拟回流路径上。这一节把&quot;片上版图&quot;和&quot;板级 PCB&quot;放在一起讲，因为两者共享同一组物理直觉：失配来自梯度，噪声来自回流环路，可靠性来自电流密度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-从原理图到物理的失真链\">核心概念：从原理图到物理的失真链</h2><p>版图阶段引入的失真不是随机的，而是沿着一条可追踪的因果链传播。器件级有失配（mismatch）与寄生（parasitics），互连级有 IR 压降与电迁移（electromigration），板级有回流路径与耦合。把这条链画出来，能帮你判断一个性能问题该回到哪一层去修。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[原理图: 理想器件] --&gt; B[器件版图]&#10;  B --&gt; C{失配源}&#10;  C --&gt; C1[工艺梯度&lt;br/&gt;氧化层/掺杂]&#10;  C --&gt; C2[热梯度/应力&lt;br/&gt;well proximity]&#10;  C --&gt; C3[边界效应&lt;br/&gt;端部器件不对称]&#10;  B --&gt; D[寄生 RC&lt;br/&gt;需 PEX 提取]&#10;  D --&gt; E[后仿真&lt;br/&gt;带寄生的 SPICE]&#10;  B --&gt; F[互连可靠性]&#10;  F --&gt; F1[IR 压降]&#10;  F --&gt; F2[电迁移 EM]&#10;  A --&gt; G[PCB 版图]&#10;  G --&gt; H[回流路径/环路面积]&#10;  G --&gt; I[去耦/平面电容]&#10;  H --&gt; J[信号完整性 SI]&#10;  I --&gt; K[电源完整性 PI]\">flowchart TD\n  A[原理图: 理想器件] --&gt; B[器件版图]\n  B --&gt; C{失配源}\n  C --&gt; C1[工艺梯度&lt;br/&gt;氧化层/掺杂]\n  C --&gt; C2[热梯度/应力&lt;br/&gt;well proximity]\n  C --&gt; C3[边界效应&lt;br/&gt;端部器件不对称]\n  B --&gt; D[寄生 RC&lt;br/&gt;需 PEX 提取]\n  D --&gt; E[后仿真&lt;br/&gt;带寄生的 SPICE]\n  B --&gt; F[互连可靠性]\n  F --&gt; F1[IR 压降]\n  F --&gt; F2[电迁移 EM]\n  A --&gt; G[PCB 版图]\n  G --&gt; H[回流路径/环路面积]\n  G --&gt; I[去耦/平面电容]\n  H --&gt; J[信号完整性 SI]\n  I --&gt; K[电源完整性 PI]</pre><p>下表对比片上版图与 PCB 在同一关注点上的不同手段——两层用的是同一套物理，但工具和尺度差几个数量级。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>关注点</th>\n<th>片上版图（IC）</th>\n<th>PCB 板级</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>失配/对称</td>\n<td>共质心、叉指、dummy 器件</td>\n<td>差分对等长、对称布局</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>寄生控制</td>\n<td>PEX 提取后仿真（Quantus / StarRC）</td>\n<td>阻抗受控走线、参考平面连续</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回流/噪声</td>\n<td>衬底隔离、guard ring</td>\n<td>完整地平面、单点连接</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电流可靠性</td>\n<td>电迁移 + IR 校验</td>\n<td>铜厚/线宽、过孔载流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>制造性</td>\n<td>DFM 检查（in-design）</td>\n<td>DFM/DRC、阻焊与间距规则</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"片上匹配-共质心-叉指与-dummy\">片上匹配：共质心、叉指与 dummy</h2><p>模拟精度的核心矛盾是：两个&quot;理论上相同&quot;的器件，因为坐落在晶圆的不同位置，会因氧化层厚度、掺杂浓度的空间梯度而产生失配。匹配技术的全部目标，就是让这种梯度对一对（或一组）器件产生相同的影响，从而在差分量中抵消。</p>\n<p>最常用的是共质心（common-centroid）布局：把器件 A 和 B 各拆成多个单元，交错排布，使所有 A 单元的几何质心与所有 B 单元的质心重合。这样一阶线性梯度——无论方向如何——对两者贡献相等。一个差分对常用 ABBA / BAAB 这样的二维 cross-quad 排布。叉指（interdigitation）是它的一维简化：把器件指条交替成 A B A B A B，让局部变化被平均掉（<a href=\"https://analoghub.ie/category/Layout/article/layoutMatching\">AnalogHub: Matching in layout</a>）。</p>\n<p>边界是匹配的隐形杀手。阵列两端的器件刻蚀环境与中间不同，端部的有源单元会系统性偏离。解决办法是在两端加 dummy（哑元）器件，让所有&quot;真器件&quot;都处在相同的邻域里。dummy 自身被牺牲掉，只为给核心器件营造统一的边界条件（<a href=\"https://resources.pcb.cadence.com/view-all/2020-analog-layout-basics-for-pcb-design\">Cadence: Analog Layout Basics</a>）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[差分对 M1 / M2] --&gt; B[拆成多单元]&#10;  B --&gt; C[共质心交错&lt;br/&gt;质心重合]&#10;  C --&gt; D[抵消一阶线性梯度]&#10;  A --&gt; E[阵列两端]&#10;  E --&gt; F[加 dummy 器件&lt;br/&gt;统一边界条件]&#10;  C --&gt; G[加 guard ring&lt;br/&gt;共用阱/隔离]\">graph TD\n  A[差分对 M1 / M2] --&gt; B[拆成多单元]\n  B --&gt; C[共质心交错&lt;br/&gt;质心重合]\n  C --&gt; D[抵消一阶线性梯度]\n  A --&gt; E[阵列两端]\n  E --&gt; F[加 dummy 器件&lt;br/&gt;统一边界条件]\n  C --&gt; G[加 guard ring&lt;br/&gt;共用阱/隔离]</pre><p>还有两类容易被忽视的版图相关效应（LDE）：阱邻近效应（well proximity effect, WPE）会让靠近阱边界的器件阈值电压偏移，匹配对必须与阱边保持相同距离；天线效应（antenna effect）则在制造刻蚀时把电荷积累到栅上击穿氧化层，标准对策是在敏感栅极接一只反偏的天线二极管（扩散区）泄放电荷（<a href=\"https://www.ee.iitm.ac.in/vlsi/_media/courses/ee5325_2019/ee5325_lecture48_6nov2019.pdf\">IIT Madras: Analog Layout Techniques</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"互连可靠性-寄生-ir-压降与电迁移\">互连可靠性：寄生、IR 压降与电迁移</h2><p>把器件画对只是一半。连接它们的金属线会引入寄生电阻和电容，在高速节点上这些寄生足以吃掉相位裕度、拖慢建立时间。后仿真（post-layout simulation）的前提是寄生提取（PEX）：从版图反推出每段互连的等效 RC 网络，再灌回 SPICE 重跑。业界主力工具是 Cadence Quantus 与 Synopsys StarRC，后者被称为&quot;提取的黄金标准&quot;（<a href=\"https://www.synopsys.com/glossary/what-is-parasitic-extraction.html\">Synopsys: What is Parasitic Extraction</a>、<a href=\"https://www.cadence.com/en_US/home/explore/parasitic-extraction.html\">Cadence: Parasitic Extraction</a>）。</p>\n<p>互连的两类可靠性失效都与电流密度有关：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>IR 压降</strong>：电流流过有限电阻的电源网格，在各点产生压降，远端器件拿到的供电低于标称，模拟偏置随之漂移。</li>\n<li><strong>电迁移（EM）</strong>：长期大电流密度下金属原子被电子流&quot;撞&quot;着迁移，逐渐形成空洞或晶须，最终开路或短路。EM 的寿命由电流密度和温度共同决定，遵循 Black 方程：</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>J</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mi>T</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{MTTF} = \\frac{A}{J^{n}}\\,\\exp\\!\\left(\\frac{E_a}{k_B T}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">MTTF</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5904em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span></span></span></span></span> 是电流密度、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 是绝对温度、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>a</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是激活能、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是玻尔兹曼常数、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 通常取 2。这个式子说明两件事：电流密度翻倍寿命掉到约四分之一；而焦耳热抬高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 会进一步加速失效——所以 EM 与 IR、热分析必须耦合做。2026 年的研究工具（如 EMSpice 2.1）已经把 EM、IR 压降与焦耳热的热图整合在同一流程里联立求解，正是因为单独看任何一项都会低估风险（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/html/2507.00270\">arXiv: EMSpice 2.1</a>）。</p>\n<p>Cadence Virtuoso Power System 把 IR 压降与 EM 校验做成&quot;in-design&quot;——在画版图的同时给出 signoff 级别的电源/信号完整性反馈，并能在 Virtuoso 环境内自动定位和修复 DFM 违规，而不是等到流片前才发现问题（<a href=\"https://www.chipestimate.com/Update-Cadence-Enhances-Unified-CustomAnalog-Flow-to-Boost-Productivity-at-Nodes-Down-to-20nm/Cadence/news/9078\">ChipEstimate: Cadence Unified Custom/Analog Flow</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"pcb-板级-回流路径与地平面的真相\">PCB 板级：回流路径与地平面的真相</h2><p>板级最持久的一个误区，是&quot;模拟地和数字地必须用一刀切的分割平面隔开&quot;。Analog Devices 与多家板厂在 2025–2026 年的指南里反复强调：分割地平面的初衷（隔离数字噪声）是对的，但实现几乎总是制造出更多问题——被割断的平面会逼迫高速信号的回流电流绕远路，放大环路面积，反而把噪声辐射出去（<a href=\"https://www.schemalyzer.com/en/blog/pcb-design/best-practices/pcb-ground-plane-design\">Schemalyzer: PCB Ground Plane Design</a>、<a href=\"https://www.allpcb.com/allelectrohub/analog-pcb-grounding-the-star-ground-myth-debunked\">AllPCB: The Star Ground Myth Debunked</a>）。</p>\n<p>正确的心智模型不是&quot;分开地&quot;，而是&quot;给每一类信号一条清晰、合适的回流参考&quot;。高频电流总是沿着正下方阻抗最低的路径回流；只要保持参考平面连续、不在高速走线下方开槽或挖大空洞，回流环路自然最小。当确实需要区分模拟域与数字域时，让两者各自在完整平面上布局，仅在电源入口附近用单点连接，从而阻止数字回流电流穿过模拟地注入噪声（<a href=\"https://www.analog.com/en/resources/analog-dialogue/articles/what-are-the-basic-guidelines-for-layout-design-of-mixed-signal-pcbs.html\">Analog Devices: Mixed-Signal PCB Layout Guidelines</a>）。</p>\n<p>几条与回流同源的实操规则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>模拟走线短而直，每多一个过孔或拐弯都增加寄生；高速走线下方避免分割、缩颈和大面积挖空，否则阻抗不可预测（<a href=\"https://resources.altium.com/p/pcb-ground-plane-best-practices-your-multilayer-stackup\">Altium: Ground Plane Best Practices</a>）。</li>\n<li>多层板上大量使用地缝合过孔（stitching via），把各层地平面缝在一起，为换层信号提供就近回流路径。</li>\n<li>去耦电容（典型 0.1 μF 陶瓷）紧贴 IC 电源引脚放置，在噪声扩散前就近旁路到地。</li>\n<li>电源平面与地平面相邻叠层，利用平面间电容获得额外的高频去耦——这是任何分立电容都给不到的最快旁路。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>对高速 ADC 这类混合信号器件，参考平面的连续性直接决定 ENOB：一条压在模拟回流路径上的数字时钟走线，足以把动态范围拉低好几位（<a href=\"https://arshon.com/blog/pcb-design-for-high-speed-adc-comprehensive-guide/\">Arshon: PCB Design for High-Speed ADC</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>版图不是&quot;画连线&quot;，它是把原理图的理想器件落到有梯度、有寄生、有电流密度的真实物理上——性能损失沿&quot;失配→寄生→可靠性→回流&quot;链传播，定位问题要先定位它在哪一层。</li>\n<li>片上匹配靠共质心/叉指抵消一阶梯度，靠 dummy 统一边界，靠 guard ring 与 dummy 同向布局对抗 WPE、靠天线二极管泄放刻蚀电荷。</li>\n<li>互连可靠性是电流密度问题：寄生用 PEX（Quantus/StarRC）提取后做后仿真；IR 压降与电迁移（Black 方程，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow><mo>∝</mo><msup><mi>J</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mi>T</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{MTTF}\\propto J^{-n}e^{E_a/k_BT}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">MTTF</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3567em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1433em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）必须与焦耳热耦合分析，2026 的工具已把三者联立。</li>\n<li>PCB 上&quot;分割地平面&quot;多半是反模式；真正要保证的是回流参考连续、环路面积最小、去耦就近、电源/地平面相邻——混合信号设计的 ENOB 由这些细节兑现。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"模拟版图与 PCB","id":"模拟版图与-pcb"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：从原理图到物理的失真链","id":"核心概念-从原理图到物理的失真链"},{"level":2,"text":"片上匹配：共质心、叉指与 dummy","id":"片上匹配-共质心-叉指与-dummy"},{"level":2,"text":"互连可靠性：寄生、IR 压降与电迁移","id":"互连可靠性-寄生-ir-压降与电迁移"},{"level":2,"text":"PCB 板级：回流路径与地平面的真相","id":"pcb-板级-回流路径与地平面的真相"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"噪声与失真","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/analog-circuit-design/practice-and-reliability/noise-and-distortion"},"next":{"title":"电源管理与基准电压","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/analog-circuit-design/practice-and-reliability/power-management-and-references"}}